  "action": "Assessed the pasted LLM-trading-bot concept for Indodax/Tokocrypto after the librarian lane was credit-depleted. Verified directly from ccxt source that both indodax and tokocrypto are supported (with caveats: indodax spot-only, no fetchMyTrades/stop orders, cancelOrder needs side; tokocrypto certified=false, Binance-routed). Found the decisive flaw: the described 0.3-0.5% take-profit is below the ~0.6% Indodax round-trip fee (and ~1.0% with Indonesian tax), so the strategy is negative-expectancy even at 100% win rate. Flagged unverified items (exact fees, tax rates, LLM pricing, 'Muse' model). QMS 20261002-pass-idx-llm-bot-feasibility filed."
